  lines=["A moose king with golden antlers! So shiny!", "Pharaoh Tutankhamoose. Divine ruler. Does not fit through doors.", "They saw a moose, panicked, and made him a fucking GOD. He's nine feet wide. Nobody's told him."],
  gear=[("Crook and Flail, Chewed", "Symbols of divine kingship. He thought they were snacks."), ("Gold Broad Collar", "Forty pounds of gold. He has not noticed."), ("Scarab of the Wrong Continent", "Carved in lapis. Shows, for some reason, a pine tree.")],
  set=("Divine Antler", ["Nemes Headcloth, Cut for Antlers", "Royal Pleated Kilt", "Gilded Hoof Sandals"]),
